---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <!-- ====== HERO / INTRO ====== -->
  <section class="mb-12">
    <p class="mono-eyebrow mb-2"><span class="text-accent-blue">$</span> whoami</p>
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-text sm:text-4xl">
      <span class="glitch is-live" data-text="Hi, welcome!">Hi, welcome!</span><span class="cursor-blink align-middle"></span>
    </h1>
    <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-body">
      I am Karolina, a Ph.D. candidate in cybersecurity at Télécom Paris and Ledger Donjon. My research combines formal verification methods with practical security engineering to address vulnerabilities in production systems.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== RESEARCH INTERESTS ====== -->
  <section class="mb-12">
    <p class="mono-eyebrow mb-1">// warning: rabbit holes ahead</p>
    <h2 class="glitch mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-brand-text" data-text="Research Interests">Research Interests</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-brand-body">
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="select-none font-mono text-accent-green">▹</span>Symbolic execution and formal verification of protocols,</li>
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="select-none font-mono text-accent-green">▹</span>Software and networks security,</li>
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="select-none font-mono text-accent-green">▹</span>Binaries analysis,</li>
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="select-none font-mono text-accent-green">▹</span>Secure compilation and hardware-software interactions,</li>
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="select-none font-mono text-accent-green">▹</span>Zero-knowledge proof systems,</li>
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="select-none font-mono text-accent-green">▹</span>Languages: <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent-blue">Rust</span>, <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent-blue">Go</span>, <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent-blue">Assembly</span>.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== PULL-QUOTE ====== -->
  <section class="mb-12">
    <figure class="rounded-xl bg-accent-green/5 p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-brand-text sm:text-xl">
        When things are beautifully done, there is usually a well thought out sort of abstraction layers.
      </p>
      <figcaption class="mt-3 font-mono text-sm text-accent-emerald">
        Jim Keller
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== CURRENT MAIN PROJECT (ZORYA) ====== -->
  <section class="mb-12">
    <p class="mono-eyebrow mb-1">// it works on my machine</p>
    <h2 class="glitch mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-brand-text" data-text="My Current Main Project">My Current Main Project</h2>
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-white/50 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-accent-green/60">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2">
        <!-- Info panel -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
            <img src="/images/zorya_logo.png" alt="ZORYA logo" class="h-16 w-auto object-contain" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-border bg-brand-bg px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-muted">
              <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-accent-green"></span> active
            </span>
            <h3 class="sr-only">ZORYA</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-body">
            I'm the main developer of <strong>ZORYA</strong>, a concolic execution framework for binary-level vulnerability analysis, with a strong focus on Go binaries. Written in Rust, it initializes execution from real runtime state (CPU + memory dumps), translates code to Ghidra's low-level P-Code, and explores paths with concrete and symbolic values using the Z3 SMT solver.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/Ledger-Donjon/zorya"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-brand-text px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-accent-emerald"
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-4 w-4" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
            View on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Terminal mock -->
        <div class="border-t border-brand-border md:border-l md:border-t-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-brand-border bg-brand-bg px-4 py-2.5">
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-band-oo/70"></span>
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-band-multi-par/70"></span>
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-accent-green/70"></span>
            <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-xs text-brand-muted">karolina@donjon:~/zorya</span>
          </div>
          <div class="scanlines bg-zinc-50 p-4 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed sm:text-[13px]">
            <p><span class="text-accent-green">$</span> <span class="text-brand-body">zorya tests/programs/crashme-go/crashme-go \</span></p>
            <p class="text-brand-body">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;--lang go --compiler tinygo --mode main</p>
            <p class="text-accent-cyan">[zorya] init state from CPU + memory dump</p>
            <p class="text-accent-cyan">[zorya] lifting to Ghidra P-Code</p>
            <p class="text-accent-cyan">[zorya] solving paths (concrete + symbolic) via Z3</p>
            <p class="text-band-multi-par">[found] nil pointer dereference &nbsp;@ crashme.crash</p>
            <p class="text-accent-emerald">[done] &nbsp;results written to results/</p>
            <p><span class="text-accent-green">$</span> <span class="cursor-blink align-middle"></span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== INNOVATION & PROTOTYPING / HACKATHONS ====== -->
  <section class="mb-12">
    <p class="mono-eyebrow mb-1">// ship first, sleep later</p>
    <h2 class="glitch mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-brand-text" data-text="Innovation &amp; Prototyping">Innovation &amp; Prototyping</h2>
    <p class="mb-6 text-brand-body">
      Applied research requires iteration between theoretical frameworks and empirical validation. Through competitive hackathons and collaborative prototyping events, I develop proof-of-concept implementations that test security hypotheses in constrained timeframes. This rapid experimentation informs my doctoral research by exposing practical limitations of formal methods, revealing emergent attack vectors in Layer 2 systems, and fostering interdisciplinary collaboration. The projects below demonstrate how theoretical security analysis translates into functional tools and protocols.
    </p>
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- ETH Global Brussels 2024 -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <img src="/images/onchainguard-logo-1.png" alt="OnchainGuard logo" class="mx-auto mb-3 h-20 w-auto" loading="lazy" />
        <h3 class="mb-1 text-center font-semibold text-brand-text">ETH Global Brussels 2024, Belgium</h3>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-brand-body">An onchain static analyzer for blockchain smart contracts</p>
        <div class="mt-3 flex justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="https://github.com/OnchainGuard/OnchainGuard" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://ethglobal.com/showcase/onchainguard-ki7x6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Showcase</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-xs font-medium text-blue-600">
          <li>Nethermind Price – Best Security Driven Development</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- ZK Hack 2023 -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <img src="/images/logo_prooftranslate.png" alt="ProofTranslate logo" class="mx-auto mb-3 h-20 w-auto" loading="lazy" />
        <h3 class="mb-1 text-center font-semibold text-brand-text">ZK Hack 2023, Istanbul, Turkey</h3>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-brand-body">The conversion algorithm of ZK proofs between the Polygon zkEVM system and the Scroll system.</p>
        <div class="mt-3 flex justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="https://github.com/ProofTranslate/0xProofTranslate" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://devfolio.co/projects/prooftranslate-d03b" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">Devfolio</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-xs font-medium text-blue-600">
          <li>Price for Best Idea on Polygon</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- ETH Denver 2023 -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <img src="/images/GENI_logo.png" alt="GENI logo" class="mx-auto mb-3 h-20 w-auto" loading="lazy" />
        <h3 class="mb-1 text-center font-semibold text-brand-text">ETH Denver Hackathon 2023, USA</h3>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-brand-body">The specifications' generator for security tests</p>
        <div class="mt-3 flex justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="https://github.com/0xGeni/Geni" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://app.buidlbox.io/projects/geni" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">BuidlBox</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-xs font-medium text-blue-600">
          <li>Price for Best Developer Infrastructure/tooling on Mantle</li>
          <li>Price for Best Developer tooling solution for Filecoin Virtual Machine</li>
          <li>Price for Open Aurora Bounty</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Open Climate Collabathon 2019 -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <img src="/images/collabathon.png" alt="Open Climate Collabathon" class="mx-auto mb-3 h-20 w-auto" loading="lazy" />
        <h3 class="mb-1 text-center font-semibold text-brand-text">Open Climate Collabathon 2019, HEC Paris</h3>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-brand-body">"Consumer Disclosure Contracts for Sustainable Supply Chain", based on Hyperledger</p>
        <div class="mt-3 flex justify-center">
          <a href="https://www.hec.edu/en/society-organizations-institute/events/collabathon-open-climate-hec-paris-and-yale" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-band-fn-pure underline underline-offset-2">HEC Event</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-xs font-medium text-blue-600">
          <li>Award for the Most Innovative Contribution</li>
          <li>Award of the Most Collaborative Team</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

